{
  "_comment": "Omarchy TV apps. Override or add entries in ~/.config/omarchy-tv/apps.json (same shape; an entry with the same id replaces this one, \"hidden\": true removes it). Types: web, native, terminal (a TUI in a fullscreen terminal), steam, vibes, media (built in), desktop (from the app launcher), builtin (a TV screen). 'needs' hides an entry unless every command in it is installed. 'input' is remote (keys) or gamepad (the app reads controllers itself). 'freeze' pauses the app completely while it is in the background.",
